1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Be honest.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,500
How many events are saved
on your phone right now?

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Saving feels like progress. It's not. It's research cosplay.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:14,500
You added 4 events this month
and attended none. The list is where intentions go to age.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,000
New rule: you can't save an event
without deciding on the last one.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,500
One decision beats
ten bookmarks.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Link in bio. Orbit makes you commit to one.
